{
  "name": "Shopify Competitor Price Drop & Inventory Stock Monitor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Shopify Competitor Price Drop & Inventory Stock Monitor\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nTrack product prices, variant SKUs, and out-of-stock signals across any competitor Shopify store on a daily schedule.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/universal-ecommerce-product-price-tracker`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/universal-ecommerce-product-price-tracker) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Shopify Product Scraper Prices, Stock & SKU** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "efcad0bc-d0fc-4b1c-a24a-2df5e472176d",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
